# 📸 Assets Folder - Image Guidelines

This folder contains all static assets (images, icons, etc.) used in the VibeMatch application.

## 📁 Folder Structure

```
assets/
├── images/
│   ├── products/          # Product images
│   │   ├── dresses/
│   │   ├── jewelry/
│   │   └── cosmetics/
│   ├── hero/              # Hero section images
│   ├── vibes/             # Vibe category banners
│   └── placeholders/      # Placeholder images
├── icons/                 # UI icons and logos
└── README.md             # This file
```

## 🎨 Image Requirements

### Product Images

#### Dresses (`/images/products/dresses/`)
- **Format**: JPG or PNG
- **Dimensions**: 800x1200px (2:3 ratio)
- **Background**: White or transparent
- **Naming**: `dress-[vibe]-[id].jpg`
  - Example: `dress-party-001.jpg`, `dress-wedding-001.jpg`
- **Needed Vibes**:
  - Party
  - Wedding
  - Glam
  - Cocktail
  - Casual
  - Brunch
  - Date Night
  - Festival

#### Jewelry/Ornaments (`/images/products/jewelry/`)
- **Format**: PNG with transparent background
- **Dimensions**: 600x600px (1:1 ratio)
- **Types Needed**:
  - Earrings: `earrings-[style]-[id].png`
  - Necklaces: `necklace-[style]-[id].png`
  - Bracelets: `bracelet-[style]-[id].png`
  - Rings: `ring-[style]-[id].png`
- **Styles**: gold, silver, rose-gold, diamond

#### Cosmetics (`/images/products/cosmetics/`)
- **Format**: PNG with transparent background
- **Dimensions**: 400x400px (1:1 ratio)
- **Types Needed**:
  - Lipsticks: `lipstick-[shade]-[id].png`
  - Eyeshadow palettes: `eyeshadow-[palette]-[id].png`
  - Blush: `blush-[shade]-[id].png`
  - Highlighter: `highlighter-[shade]-[id].png`
- **Undertone Categories**: warm, cool, neutral

### Hero Section (`/images/hero/`)
- **Format**: JPG (optimized)
- **Dimensions**: 1920x1080px (16:9 ratio)
- **Files Needed**:
  - `hero-main.jpg` - Main landing page background
  - `hero-quiz.jpg` - Vibe quiz background
  - `hero-recommendations.jpg` - Recommendations page background

### Vibe Category Banners (`/images/vibes/`)
- **Format**: JPG
- **Dimensions**: 1200x400px (3:1 ratio)
- **Files Needed** (one for each vibe):
  - `party-vibe.jpg`
  - `wedding-vibe.jpg`
  - `glam-vibe.jpg`
  - `cocktail-vibe.jpg`
  - `casual-vibe.jpg`
  - `brunch-vibe.jpg`
  - `date-night-vibe.jpg`
  - `festival-vibe.jpg`

### Icons (`/icons/`)
- **Format**: SVG or PNG
- **Dimensions**: 64x64px for PNG, scalable for SVG
- **Files Needed**:
  - `logo.svg` - App logo
  - `logo-white.svg` - White version for dark backgrounds
  - `favicon.ico` - Browser favicon (16x16, 32x32, 64x64)
  - `dress-icon.svg` - Dress category icon
  - `jewelry-icon.svg` - Jewelry category icon
  - `cosmetic-icon.svg` - Cosmetic category icon

